			"color":"#2a5a2a",
			"widgets_values":[
				"For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <P> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nsubject_definitions:\n<P> is a highly detailed subject characterized by cinematic lighting and rich texture details, serving as the primary visual anchor for the entire sequence.\n\nsummary:\n[audio reference] The narrative unfolds through a seamless flow where <A> acts as a weak_reference to guide the pacing and emotional intensity of the visuals without overpowering them.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<P> maintains consistent continuity across all shots, while <A> drives the rhythmic delivery and subtle micro-expressions, ensuring the audience remains locked into the visual story.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] At an immersive environment with a global GI setup, the camera opens in a Wide Shot to reveal <P>. The subject moves dynamically through the space; [Chinese] \"欢迎来到这个光影交织的世界，感受此刻的呼吸。\"\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.350, the shot transitions to an Extreme Close-Up focusing on the eyes and lips of <P> as she delivers a key emotional beat; [Chinese] \"在这里，时间仿佛凝固在每一寸纹理之中。\"\n[Shot 3] At 00:10.720, the camera cuts to a Low Angle looking up at <P>, emphasizing dominance or grandeur before returning to center frame for a final lingering moment; [Chinese] \"让这光芒指引你前行的方向，直到最后的一秒。\"\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe crisp intake of breath syncing with every movement; the subtle friction of fabric against skin as she navigates the scene.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA driving orchestral build-up featuring a pulsating cello section at 90 BPM, layered with ethereal synth pads that swell on impact without masking dialogue."
			],
